        }
        Markdown("- **`Code(\"…\")`** is inline code. Placed between two `Text`s, it reads as part of the sentence.\n- **`Code(\"…\").block`** is a block, for code over several lines.\n- **`language:`** colours it — `wf`, `json`, `bash` or `css`. The colouring is done at build time and in the browser alike, with the theme's `syntax-*` tokens, and a `Markdown` fence in one of those languages is coloured the same way.")

